<section class="admin-panel" id="panel-site-controls" data-module="site-controls" hidden>
  <div class="panel-header">
    <h2><span class="t-ja">公開設定・バックアップ</span><span class="t-cn">显示设置与源码备份</span><span class="t-en">Visibility &amp; Backup</span></h2>
    <p>
      <span class="t-ja">R18作品の非表示切り替え、上部お知らせ、機能スイッチ、およびソースコード一式のバックアップをダウンロードできます。</span>
      <span class="t-cn">这里可切换 R18 作品隐藏、设置顶部公告、调整功能开关，并下载整站源码包备份。</span>
      <span class="t-en">Toggle R18 visibility, set a top notice, adjust feature flags, or download the full static source bundle for backup or self-hosting.</span>
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="ctrl-block">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="grow">
          <strong><span class="t-ja">R18作品の表示</span><span class="t-cn">R18 作品显示</span><span class="t-en">R18 visibility</span></strong>
          <div class="desc" id="r18-state">—</div>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="btn mini" id="r18-toggle">—</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ctrl-block">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="grow">
          <strong><span class="t-ja">トップお知らせバナー</span><span class="t-cn">顶部公告栏</span><span class="t-en">Top notice banner</span></strong>
          <div class="desc"><span class="t-ja">公開ページの先頭に一行の案内を表示します。空にして保存すると消えます。</span><span class="t-cn">在首页顶部显示一行公告。清空后保存即消失。</span><span class="t-en">Shows a one-line notice at the top of the public site. Save empty to clear.</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row"><input type="text" id="notice-input" maxlength="160" /></div>
      <div class="row">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary mini" id="notice-save"><span class="t-ja">保存</span><span class="t-cn">保存</span><span class="t-en">Save</span></button>
        <button type="button" class="btn mini" id="notice-clear"><span class="t-ja">消去</span><span class="t-cn">清除</span><span class="t-en">Clear</span></button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ctrl-block">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="grow">
          <strong><span class="t-ja">サイトデータのアーカイブ保存（ZIP）</span><span class="t-cn">整站档案打包下载（ZIP）</span><span class="t-en">Site archive bundle (ZIP)</span></strong>
          <div class="desc"><span class="t-ja">ご希望の際はいつでも公開データ一式を手元に保存できます（連絡ボックス内のメッセージは含まれません）。</span><span class="t-cn">如有需要可随时将整站结构与公开数据完整打包留存或自行托管（绝不含联络信箱消息）。</span><span class="t-en">Download the site files &amp; public data as a ZIP (private messages are never included) for archival or self-hosting.</span></div>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="btn mini" id="btn-download"><span class="t-ja">ダウンロード</span><span class="t-cn">下载</span><span class="t-en">Download</span> ↓</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="status" id="status-controls"></p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-subhead">
      <h3><span class="t-ja">機能スイッチ</span><span class="t-cn">功能开关</span><span class="t-en">Feature Switches</span></h3>
    </div>
    <p class="note">
      <span class="t-ja">公開ページの表示セクションを切り替えるスイッチです（通常は変更不要です）。</span>
      <span class="t-cn">用于控制公开页特定区块的显示开关（通常保持默认即可）。</span>
      <span class="t-en">Optional toggles for individual public sections (usually left as-is).</span>
    </p>
    <div class="flag-list" id="flag-list"></div>
    <p class="status" id="status-flags"></p>
  </div>
</section>
